{"id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding.md","title":"有限图与大小可控的二进制编码","display":"df-finite-graph-binary-coding — 有限图与大小可控的二进制编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","aliases":["73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding"],"display":"df-finite-graph-binary-coding — 有限图与大小可控的二进制编码","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.1–10.4.3, print pp. 459–464; PDF pp. 481–486; local explicit adjacency-matrix encoding","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-graph-binary-coding — 有限图与大小可控的二进制编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.1–10.4.3, print pp. 459–464; PDF pp. 481–486; local explicit adjacency-matrix encoding"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为候选边集；顶点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> 在下式构造。无向边是两元素集合，有向边是有序对。仅在矩阵点值子句中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in V_n\">\\(i,j\\in V_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,D\">\\(U,D\\)</span> 是两个固定互异的索引标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\{U,D\\}\">\\(X\\in\\{U,D\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=U\">\\(X=U\\)</span> 的矩阵及编码子句以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span> 为前提，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=D\">\\(X=D\\)</span> 的对应子句以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\)</span> 为前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_n\\coloneqq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_n\\coloneqq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i&lt;j\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in V_n^2:i\\ne j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i&lt;j\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in V_n^2:i\\ne j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_E^U(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;\\{i,j\\}\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nB_E^D(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;(i,j)\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;(i,j)\\notin E.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_E^U(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;\\{i,j\\}\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nB_E^D(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;(i,j)\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;(i,j)\\notin E.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GCode}^X(0,\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^n\\langle0\\rangle\n\\langle B_E^X(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h&lt;n^2\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1,\\ X\\in\\{U,D\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GCode}^X(0,\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^n\\langle0\\rangle\n\\langle B_E^X(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h&lt;n^2\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1,\\ X\\in\\{U,D\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GI}^X(n,E,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\langle1\\rangle^k\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)|=n^2+n+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GI}^X(n,E,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\langle1\\rangle^k\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)|=n^2+n+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>n=0 时矩阵列表为空，不求值 h/n。先解析 n，再精确读取 n² 位，余下为参数 k；合格性检查包括无向对称、对角线为零、参数字段完整。编码在各自的 U/D 类型上单射。节点重命名只改变编码，不改变图问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"V_n","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in V_n","display":false},{"tex":"U,D","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\{U,D\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X=U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"X=D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"V_n\\coloneqq\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{\\{i,j\\}:i,j\\in V_n\\land i<j\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\Longleftrightarrow E\\subseteq\\{(i,j)\\in V_n^2:i\\ne j\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B_E^U(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\{i,j\\}\\in E,\\\\0,&\\{i,j\\}\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nB_E^D(i,j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&(i,j)\\in E,\\\\0,&(i,j)\\notin E.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GCode}^X(0,\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^n\\langle0\\rangle\n\\langle B_E^X(\\lfloor h/n\\rfloor,h\\bmod n):0\\le h<n^2\\rangle\\quad(n\\ge1,\\ X\\in\\{U,D\\}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GI}^X(n,E,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)\\langle1\\rangle^k\\langle0\\rangle,\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{GCode}^X(n,E)|=n^2+n+1.","display":true}],"bytes":2276,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a2d7611bb7648a0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5866f606e95cdcc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)$，$S\\subseteq V_n$，$k\\in\\mathbb N$。编码采用 [[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]；本地允许 k=0 或 k>n，分别按精确存在条件解释。"},{"id":"02358e8c320b1ace","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1eb6b14c0b3fd700","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aa25b0fd9e2cf41e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding|有限图与大小可控的二进制编码]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["bc88ca69b33d5036"]}